NAME
    tables - table forms and width
    fitting

CAP
    A short column and two long ones;
    only the long ones give up width.
    1: abcdef
    2: twelve-chars twelve-chars and
      more words to thirty
    3: fourteen-chars fourteen-chars
      more words until the cell reaches
      fifty

ALLBOX
    --------+---------------------------
     NUMBER           CENTERED
    --------+---------------------------
          1              one
    --------+---------------------------
         22          twenty two
    --------+---------------------------
        333     three hundred thirty
                        three
    --------+---------------------------

WIDTH
     key            a column with a
                    minimum width of
                    twelve

RECORDS
    1: supercalifragilistic
    2: antidisestablishmentarianism
    3: floccinaucinihilipilification
    4: pneumonoultramicroscopic

LITERAL IN A DEFINITION
    -e expr
        srt -e 'one'
        srt -e 'two'

    -v  verbose.
